---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
---
<Base title="Privacy policy" description="How we collect, use and protect your data.">
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
    <p class="lead">Last updated: September 2026</p>
  </section>
  <section class="section prose fade-in">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0">What we collect</h2>
    <p>We collect only what you give us voluntarily through our forms:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Contact and order forms</strong> -- your name, email address, company name and message. These are stored on our servers and sent to us by email.</li>
      <li><strong>Newsletter signups</strong> -- your email address only.</li>
      <li><strong>Tool submissions</strong> -- the tool name, URL, description and your contact email.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We never see your card details. Payments are taken by Dodo Payments, the merchant of record, on their checkout page. We keep a record of what was bought, by which email address, and its payment status.</p>

    <h2>How we use your data</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To reply to your enquiry or process your order.</li>
      <li>To send the newsletter you signed up for (you can unsubscribe any time).</li>
      <li>To list a tool you submitted, after review.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not sell, rent or share your personal data with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>

    <h2>Third-party services</h2>
    <p>The site uses a small number of external services:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Dodo Payments</strong> -- processes payments as merchant of record. We never see your card number. <a href="https://dodopayments.com/privacy-policy" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Their privacy policy</a>.</li>
      <li><strong>Our own servers</strong> (hosted on Heroku, database on Supabase) -- store form submissions, tool listings and order records.</li>
      <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong> -- loads typefaces. Google may log your IP address. <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Their privacy policy</a>.</li>
      <li><strong>Netlify / Vercel</strong> (or whichever host you deploy to) -- serves the site and may log IP addresses and request data in server logs.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>This site does not set first-party cookies. Third-party services listed above may set their own cookies. You can block or delete cookies through your browser settings at any time.</p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>You can ask us to show, correct or delete any personal data we hold about you. Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> and we will respond within 7 days.</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The "last updated" date at the top of this page shows when the latest change was made.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
  </section>
</Base>
